      "section": "অনুশীলনী ৫.২",
      "caption": null,
      "body": "১. $\\sqrt{x - 4} + 2 = \\sqrt{x + 12}$\n২. $\\sqrt{11x - 6} = \\sqrt{4x + 5} - \\sqrt{x - 1}$\n৩. $\\sqrt{2x + 7} + \\sqrt{3x - 18} = \\sqrt{7x + 1}$\n৪. $\\sqrt{x + 4} + \\sqrt{x + 11} = \\sqrt{8x + 9}$\n৫. $\\sqrt{11x - 6} = \\sqrt{4x + 5} + \\sqrt{x - 1}$\n৬. $\\sqrt{x^2 - 8} + \\sqrt{x^2 - 14} = 6$\n৭. $\\sqrt{x^2 - 6x + 9} - \\sqrt{x^2 - 6x + 6} = 1$\n৮. $\\sqrt{x - 2} - \\sqrt{x - 9} = 1$\n৯. $6\\sqrt{\\frac{2x}{x - 1}} + 5\\sqrt{\\frac{x - 1}{2x}} = 13$\n১০. $\\sqrt{\\frac{x - 1}{3x + 2}} + 2\\sqrt{\\frac{3x + 2}{x - 1}} = 3$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\sqrt{x - 4} + 2 = \\sqrt{x + 12}",
        "\\sqrt{11x - 6} = \\sqrt{4x + 5} - \\sqrt{x - 1}",
        "\\sqrt{2x + 7} + \\sqrt{3x - 18} = \\sqrt{7x + 1}",
        "\\sqrt{x + 4} + \\sqrt{x + 11} = \\sqrt{8x + 9}",
        "\\sqrt{11x - 6} = \\sqrt{4x + 5} + \\sqrt{x - 1}",
        "\\sqrt{x^2 - 8} + \\sqrt{x^2 - 14} = 6",
        "\\sqrt{x^2 - 6x + 9} - \\sqrt{x^2 - 6x + 6} = 1",
        "\\sqrt{x - 2} - \\sqrt{x - 9} = 1",
        "6\\sqrt{\\frac{2x}{x - 1}} + 5\\sqrt{\\frac{x - 1}{2x}} = 13",
        "\\sqrt{\\frac{x - 1}{3x + 2}} + 2\\sqrt{\\frac{3x + 2}{x - 1}} = 3"
      ],
